{"place_name":"廣鬱縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"广郁县","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"9764d9c1-db0e-11ef-9114-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西甌","place_name_jianti_auto":"西瓯","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"9764d9c2-db0e-11ef-8151-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"駱越","place_name_jianti_auto":"骆越","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"9764d9c3-db0e-11ef-b59a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"烏滸","place_name_jianti_auto":"乌浒","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"9764d9c4-db0e-11ef-8b6a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"烏滸","place_name_jianti_auto":"乌浒","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"9764d9c5-db0e-11ef-a3fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南海郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南海郡","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"9764d9c6-db0e-11ef-9b83-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安南府","place_name_jianti_auto":"安南府","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"9764d9c7-db0e-11ef-84f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"朔寧郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"朔宁郡","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"9764d9c8-db0e-11ef-8cae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"萬震曰：烏滸之地，在廣州之南，交州之北。賢曰：烏滸，南方夷號也。廣州記曰：其俗食人，以鼻飲酒，口中進噉如故。劉昫曰：貴州鬱平縣，漢鬱林廣鬱縣地，古西甌駱越所居，谷永招降烏滸，開置七縣，卽此也。杜佑曰：烏滸地在今南海郡之西南，安南府北朔寧郡管。滸，呼古翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"万震曰：乌浒之地，在广州之南，交州之北。贤曰：乌浒，南方夷号也。广州记曰：其俗食人，以鼻饮酒，口中进噉如故。刘昫曰：贵州郁平县，汉郁林广郁县地，古西瓯骆越所居，谷永招降乌浒，开置七县，即此也。杜佑曰：乌浒地在今南海郡之西南，安南府北朔宁郡管。浒，呼古翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"9764d9b3-db0e-11ef-9279-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"鬱林太守","official_note":"鬱林太守是汉代鬱林郡的最高行政长官，负责治理该郡的民政、司法和军事事务。在《资治通鉴》此段中，鬱林太守谷永通过恩信招降乌浒人，体现了地方官员在边疆管理和民族安抚中的作用。","official_rank":"郡守（约二千石）","source_snippet":"鬱林太守谷永","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"76ece333-2ee7-4f24-8eb6-c621a94e8caa"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-8,"link_td_description":"谷永，西汉大臣，字子云，原名并，长安人。","link_td_id":"Q10013197","link_td_number_id":1572704,"people_name":"谷永","people_name_jianti_auto":"谷永","people_xingming":"谷永","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9764d9ca-db0e-11ef-a4bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鬱林","place_name_jianti_auto":"郁林","resolved_place_entity_id":1671,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9764d9cb-db0e-11ef-a8a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"烏滸","place_name_jianti_auto":"乌浒","resolved_place_entity_id":4986,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9764d9cc-db0e-11ef-8663-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、浔州府（卷一百八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"晋始曰郁平。唐为贵州治。《新唐书》贵州治郁林，误也。宋初...","context_before":"...郁平废县[即县治。汉广郁县地。刘昫曰：古西瓯、骆越所居。","source_end_index":70,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4428e343-22b5-544a-935c-b4c7941018f1","source_start_index":29,"source_text":"后汉灵帝建宁三年，谷永为郁林太守，招降乌浦人十余万，开置七县，今贵州境内皆是其地。"}],"path":"广西方舆纪要/四、浔州府（卷一百八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、南宁府（卷一百十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"熹平末，合浦、交趾乌浦蛮反。光和四年，刺史朱㒞破之。盖是...","context_before":"乌浒山[州东六十里。昔乌浒蛮所居之地，亦曰乌浦。","source_end_index":51,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a03946c1-ae6a-5df3-b9bf-cf3fd419fa34","source_start_index":24,"source_text":"后汉建兴三年，郁林太守谷永招降乌浦人十余万，开置七县。"}],"path":"广西方舆纪要/七、南宁府（卷一百十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政","外交"],"content":"6冬，鬱林太守谷永以恩信招降烏滸人十餘萬，皆內屬，受冠帶，開置七縣。","content_fanyi":"冬季，郁林郡太守谷永用恩德和信义招降了乌浒人十多万人，这些人全部归附朝廷，接受了朝廷授予的冠带，设置了七个县。","content_jianti_auto":"6冬，郁林太守谷永以恩信招降乌浒人十余万，皆内属，受冠带，开置七县。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4827,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9764d9b2-db0e-11ef-a164-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9764d9d2-db0e-11ef-8518-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：乙十六行本「校尉」作「司馬」；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：乙十六行本「校尉」作「司马」；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9764d9d1-db0e-11ef-8490-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"9764d9d0-db0e-11ef-b020-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"疏勒","place_name_jianti_auto":"疏勒","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9764d9d4-db0e-11ef-8055-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"以元年疏勒弒其王也。任，音壬。敦，徒門翻。校，戶孝翻。龜茲，音丘慈。","note_content_jianti_auto":"以元年疏勒弑其王也。任，音壬。敦，徒门翻。校，户孝翻。龟兹，音丘慈。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"9764d9d3-db0e-11ef-a83e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"涼州刺史","official_note":"涼州刺史是漢代涼州的最高行政長官，負責管理涼州地區的民政、軍事等事務。在上下文中，涼州刺史孟佗派遣軍隊參與討伐疏勒的軍事行動，顯示其作為地方長官的軍事指揮權。","official_rank":"州級長官","source_snippet":"涼州刺史扶風孟佗","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"50fb7bb0-7459-4b71-84f2-f7046b7e48fa"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"從事","official_note":"從事是漢代州級長官（如刺史）的屬官，協助處理州內事務，可能涉及文書、監察或軍事等職責。在上下文中，從事任涉被派遣率領敦煌兵參與軍事行動，顯示其可能承擔軍事指揮或協調任務。","official_rank":"州級屬官","source_snippet":"遣從事任涉將敦煌兵五百人","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"2a491c0b-7b46-4dde-ab9f-433a05fbda6a"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"戊己校尉","official_note":"戊己校尉是漢代在西域設置的軍事長官，負責屯田和防務，維護漢朝在西域的統治。在上下文中，戊己校尉曹寬率軍參與討伐疏勒，體現其軍事職能。","official_rank":"校尉級","source_snippet":"戊己校尉曹寬","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"1e5d0023-eabd-4b87-9f22-533046c2595d"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"西域長史","official_note":"西域長史是漢代在西域設置的行政官員，負責管理西域事務，協調與當地政權的關係。在上下文中，西域長史張宴率軍參與討伐疏勒，顯示其兼有行政和軍事職責。","official_rank":"長史級","source_snippet":"西域長史張宴","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"7766d9ff-2593-4e7d-b394-29c3e9e492f2"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"疏勒王","official_note":"疏勒王是西域疏勒國的君主，在漢代西域體系中可能受漢朝冊封或影響。在上下文中，疏勒王內部發生殺害事件，導致朝廷無法有效治理，反映西域政權的動盪。","official_rank":"王級","source_snippet":"疏勒王連相殺害","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"3337288b-2dd6-4576-b5fb-c4b413259670"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孟佗","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟佗","people_xingming":"孟佗","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9764d9d6-db0e-11ef-b68e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"任涉","people_name_jianti_auto":"任涉","people_xingming":"任涉","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9764d9d9-db0e-11ef-ae10-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"曹寬","people_name_jianti_auto":"曹宽","people_xingming":"曹宽","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"9764d9db-db0e-11ef-86c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張宴","people_name_jianti_auto":"张宴","people_xingming":"张宴","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9764d9dc-db0e-11ef-812a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"疏勒王","people_name_jianti_auto":"疏勒王","people_xingming":"疏勒王","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"9764d9e3-db0e-11ef-9f25-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9764d9cd-db0e-11ef-a7ca-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"qí","source_anchor_text":"張宴將焉耆龜茲車師","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":38,"text":"耆","tongjian_id":"6881f3be-084d-52d5-94c1-5107c3448106"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9764d9cd-db0e-11ef-a7ca-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"qiū","source_anchor_text":"宴將焉耆龜茲車師前","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":40,"text":"龜","tongjian_id":"8e6047ee-3e68-5428-9516-af03e665638e"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"涼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉州","resolved_place_entity_id":156,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9764d9d7-db0e-11ef-b926-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_n