州刺史、扶风人孟佗派遣从事任涉率领五百名敦煌郡兵，与戊己校尉曹宽、西域长史张晏所率领的焉耆、龟兹以及车师前、后部军队会合，共三万余人征讨疏勒。他们攻打桢中城四十多天，却未能攻克，只好引兵撤退。后来疏勒王接连被杀，朝廷也无力再制服他们。","content_jianti_auto":"7凉州刺史扶风孟佗遣从事任涉将敦煌兵五百人，与戊己校尉曹宽、西域长史张宴将焉耆、龟兹、车师前、后部，合三万余人讨疏勒，攻桢中城，四十余日，不能下，引去。其后疏勒王连相杀害，朝廷亦不能复治。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4828,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9764d9cd-db0e-11ef-a7ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言其汎愛無有遺者。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言其泛爱无有遗者。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"9764d9e8-db0e-11ef-911e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"中常侍","official_note":"中常侍是东汉时期的宦官官职，负责侍从皇帝、传达诏令，常掌权柄，此处张让担任此职，显示其权势。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"中常侍張讓有監奴","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"44ae2cf0-79a9-49fd-bd64-da32be498ae8"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"涼州刺史","official_note":"涼州刺史是东汉时期凉州的最高行政长官，负责治理该州事务，此处孟佗被任命此职，反映其通过贿赂获得官职。","official_rank":"州级长官","source_snippet":"由是以佗爲涼州刺史","start_index":140,"tongjian_id":"c8abe616-dcac-4629-9c77-732d65fd48ed"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":189,"link_td_description":"张让，颍川人，东汉时的宦官，十常侍之首。","link_td_id":"Q10004821","link_td_number_id":1056092,"people_name":"張讓","people_name_jianti_auto":"张让","people_xingming":"张让","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9764d9ed-db0e-11ef-b09d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孟佗","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟佗","people_xingming":"孟佗","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"9764d9ee-db0e-11ef-a00c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"佗","people_name_jianti_auto":"佗","people_xingming":"孟佗","start_index":5